{"id":"juez","lemma":"juez","pos":"noun","rank":807,"glosses":["judge","umpire; referee; official"],"ipa":"/ˈxweθ/","gender":"mf","forms":{"plural":"jueces","feminine":"juez","femininePlural":"jueces"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/63/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-juez.wav","examples":[{"text":"No me gustaría ser juez.","en":"I wouldn't like being a judge.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553669","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"Su vida depende de la decisión del juez.","en":"His life hangs on the judge's decision.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689527","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"to depend","l":"depender"},null,null,{"g":"decision"},{"g":"of the"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"Ambos son unos jueces muy competentes.","en":"They are both very competent judges.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733494","words":[{"g":"both"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"about, approximately"},null,null,{"g":"competent","l":"competente"}]},{"text":"Tom le dijo al juez que quería otro abogado.","en":"Tom told the judge he wanted a different lawyer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/802392","words":[null,{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"someone else"},{"g":"lawyer"}]},{"text":"El juez me interrogó.","en":"The judge questioned me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439897","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to interrogate","l":"interrogar"}]}]}